                                "sense_id": "14008923-6d29-33c8-9a92-d841b4964a2b",
                                "text": "Now as pain is what we are all averſe to, our own ſenſibility of pain ſhould teach us to commiſerate it in others, to alleviate it if poſſible, but never wantonly or unmeritedly to inflict it."
